{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時25分，警方接獲途人報案，指在西貢清水灣鄉村俱樂部對開有私家車失事，私家車倒轉「頭上腳下」懸於山邊。人員到場證實私家車停在路邊，並沒衝出欄外，年約60歲的男司機已離開車廂，輕傷清醒在場等候援手。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:48.367775+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:29.071970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:29.071970+00:00","content_hash":"e09b5001de938c253482acd2cb2a44adc135d4b5e04a12362eba776296114316","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}